(49, NULL, 'Priya_AI_Software_Engineer_Resume.docx', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'priya@example.com', 'C:\\Users\\R SUVARNA\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\project\\backend\\uploads\\priya_at_example.com_Priya_AI_Software_Engineer_Resume.docx', 'PRIYA\nSoftware Engineer at TCS | AI/ML Enthusiast\nIndia  |  priya@email.com  |  +91-XXXXXXXXXX  |  linkedin.com/in/priya  |  github.com/priya\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nSoftware Engineer at TCS with a strong interest in Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and intelligent software applications. Skilled in Python, Java, SQL, web technologies, and AI/ML fundamentals, with experience building practical projects and solving software engineering problems.\nTECHNICAL SKILLS\nProgramming: Python, Java, JavaScript, SQL  |  AI/ML: Machine Learning, NLP, Generative AI, Scikit-learn  |  Web: React.js, HTML, CSS, REST APIs  |  Backend: Flask, FastAPI  |  Databases: MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB  |  Tools: Git, GitHub, VS Code, Postman  |  Core: DSA, DBMS, OOP, OS, Computer Networks\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\nTCS — Software Engineer | Hyderabad, India | 2025–Present\n• Develop and maintain enterprise software applications using Java, Python, SQL, and REST APIs.\n• Collaborate with development teams on requirements, debugging, testing, code reviews, and production support.\n• Work with relational databases and optimize SQL queries for reliable application performance.\n• Explore AI/ML and automation opportunities to improve software workflows and user experiences.\nPROJECTS\nAI-Powered Resume & Career Intelligence Platform\nReact | FastAPI | Python | NLP | Machine Learning | PostgreSQL\n• Built an AI-driven platform that extracts resume skills, analyzes skill gaps, and recommends relevant careers and jobs.\n• Implemented resume analysis and personalized recommendations through NLP and machine-learning workflows.\nAI-Based Student Performance Prediction System\nPython | Pandas | Scikit-learn | Machine Learning\n• Developed a predictive model using academic data with preprocessing, feature engineering, model training, and evaluation.\nNLP-Based Intelligent Chatbot\nPython | NLP | Flask | REST API\n• Developed a chatbot that processes user queries, classifies intents, and returns relevant responses through a web API.\nEDUCATION\nBachelor of Technology in Computer Science and Engineering\nXYZ Engineering College, India | 2021–2025 | CGPA: 8.5/10\nCERTIFICATIONS & ACHIEVEMENTS\n• Machine Learning / AI Certification • Python for Data Science • Generative AI Fundamentals\n• Solved 200+ coding problems and participated in technical competitions and project showcases.\nINTERESTS\nArtificial Intelligence • Machine Learning • Generative AI • NLP • Software Engineering • Full-Stack Development', 'PRIYA', 'priya@email.com', '', 'Programming: Python, Java, JavaScript, SQL  |  AI/ML: Machine Learning, NLP, Generative AI, Scikit-learn  |  Web: React.js, HTML, CSS, REST APIs  |  Backend: Flask, FastAPI  |  Databases: MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB  |  Tools: Git, GitHub, VS Code, Postman  |  Core: DSA, DBMS, OOP, OS, Computer Networks', 'Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science and Engineering | XYZ Engineering College, India | 2021–2025 | CGPA: 8.5/10', 'Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science and Engineering | XYZ Engineering College, India | 2021–2', 'TCS — Software Engineer | Hyderabad, India | 2025–Present | • Develop and maintain enterprise software applications using Java, Python, SQL, and REST APIs. | • Collaborate with development teams on requirements, debugging, testing, code reviews, and production support. | • Work with relational databases and optimize SQL queries for reliable application performance. | • Explore AI/ML and automation opportunities to improve software workflows and user experiences.', 'PRIYA Software Engineer at TCS | AI/ML Enthusiast India  |  priya@email.com  |  +91-XXXXXXXXXX  |  linkedin.com/in/priya  |  github.com/priya PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY Software Engineer at TCS with a strong interest in Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and intelligent software applications. Skilled in Python, Java, SQL, web technologies, and AI/ML fundamentals, with experience building practical projects and solving software engineering problems. TECHNICAL SKILLS Programming: Python, Java, JavaScript, SQL  |  AI/ML: Machine Learning, NLP, Generative AI, Scikit-learn  |  Web: React.js, HTML, CSS, REST APIs  |  Backend: Flask, FastAPI  |  Databases: MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB  |  Tools: Git, GitHub, VS Code, Postman  |  Core: DSA, DBMS, OOP, OS, Computer Networks PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE', NULL, '• Machine Learning / AI Certification • Python for Data Science • Generative AI Fundamentals | • Solved 200+ coding problems and participated in technical competitions and project showcases. | INTERESTS | Artificial Intelligence • Machine Learning • Generative AI • NLP • Software Engineering • Full-Stack Development', 'AI-Powered Resume & Career Intelligence Platform | React | FastAPI | Python | NLP | Machine Learning | PostgreSQL | • Built an AI-driven platform that extracts resume skills, analyzes skill gaps, and recommends relevant careers and jobs. | • Implemented resume analysis and personalized recommendations through NLP and machine-learning workflows. | AI-Based Student Performance Prediction System | Python | Pandas | Scikit-learn | Machine Learning | • Developed a predictive model using academic data with preprocessing, feature engineering, model training, and evaluation. | NLP-Based Intelligent Chatbot | Python | NLP | Flask | REST API | • Developed a chatbot that processes user queries, classifies intents, and returns relevant responses through a web API.'),
